WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:01.699
Hello, good morning.

00:00:01.699 --> 00:00:04.980
I'm Gary Wilson, I'm antisocial behaviour
and safeguarding officer for Teignbridge Council.

00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:09.180
We've got the police with us today and Teign
Housing with us.

00:00:09.180 --> 00:00:14.320
So we're just here today speaking to residents
just to see if there's any issues of antisocial

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:19.279
behaviour locally and just raising awareness
and how to report that behaviour.

00:00:19.279 --> 00:00:22.900
I've got a letter here just to kind of explain
to the behaviours that we'll look into and

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:25.029
if we've got any issues just let us know okay.

00:00:25.029 --> 00:00:26.029
No worries.

00:00:26.029 --> 00:00:26.730
Thank you.

